    {"type": "Feature",
     "properties": {"natural": "water", "water": "basin", "name": "Frog Pond", "why": "The Frog Pond is not mapped, so the model drew the Common's lawn where a walker finds a pool. In the aerial photographs it is a large oval concrete basin about 55 m by 35 m, ringed by a paved deck and the asphalt path: traced from the MassGIS 15 cm leaf-off aerial photographs of spring 2023 and spring 2025 (credit MassGIS) and the USGS NAIP photograph of 7 July 2023, as an ellipse fitted by eye to the picture. The pool is the inner oval, which is darker than the deck in the NAIP photograph of 7 July 2023 (full of bathers) and has a sharp edge in both dry spring photographs. It is a shallow spray pool in summer and a skating rink in winter, so it is drawn as a basin of water."},
